SUMMARY:Full Moon Aquarius Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin Senseful Wellness in the Botanical G
 ardens for some astrology explanation and a Aquarius Full Moon inspired yo
 ga flow.\nMeet Senseful Wellness in the Botanical Gardens for a yoga class
  themed around the Full moon in Aquarius.\n\nTogether we will :\n\\- Discc
 uss what the full Moon is asking from us\n\\- Flow through a full Moon ins
 pired sequence\n\\- Journal & Reflect on the full Moon\n\nWhat to bring:\n
 Journal & Pen\nWater\n\nWe will have Yoga Mats and additional props but yo
 u are welcome to bring your own.\n\nThis is a Donation Based Event\nRecomm
 ended Donation $15 - $25
